# Ruta 7 (C4a, contract 39), 32 x 16. column = i, row = j. The passage hut of the second underground passage (door (24,5)) is in the east; the road runs west to Metropolis Neon (the WEST edge,
# i = 0, rows 7..8). Look (the user's mock "Rutas 7 y 8"): the city OUTSKIRTS, closer to the city: asphalt road with dashed lanes, sidewalks, chain-link fences, road signs, street lamps, a parked car, and the animated HOLO
# BILLBOARD of the city at the west end. Three trainers (a lass, a scout, a gambler), the Neon wild table.
@map ruta_7
@size 32 16
@interior no
@area ruta_7
@bg 0
@fill lawn
@spawn hut_door 24 6 S
@spawn east 30 7 W
@spawn west 1 7 E
@encounters grass rate=20
  cindermeer 22 26 30   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  ramplet 22 26 20
  lullabun 22 26 20
  mossbud 22 26 15   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  lunelle 22 25 5
  mothmist 22 26 10   # C6 (contract 49): around Ciudad Cenit
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=lawn
  a  object=chain_i
  b  object=chain_j
  c  object=dry_bush
  d  tile=tall_grass
  e  tile=tall_grass npc=chica id=t1 face=S trainer=chica_r7 range=3 text=tr.chica_r7.pre after=tr.chica_r7.after
  f  object=house_f
  g  object=holo text=ruta7.holo interact=look
  h  object=lamp_h
  i  door=house_f
  j  object=road_sign text=ruta7.hut.sign interact=look
  k  tile=sidewalk
  l  tile=sidewalk object=road_sign text=ruta7.east.sign interact=look
  m  tile=sidewalk object=chain_j
  n  tile=asph
  o  tile=asph
  p  tile=asph object=chain_j
  q  object=car
  r  tile=tall_grass npc=explorador id=t2 face=N trainer=explorador_r7 range=3 text=tr.explorador_r7.pre after=tr.explorador_r7.after
  s  tile=tall_grass npc=jugador id=t3 face=N trainer=jugador_r7 range=3 text=tr.jugador_r7.pre after=tr.jugador_r7.after
  t  item=ward_spray
  H  tile=lawn hidden=rich_salve   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  b..............................b
  b..............................b
  b.......aaaaaaaaaaaa...........b
  b..c......ddde.....c...ff......b
  b...g....hdddd...h.....fi.j.h..b
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkklm
  noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooop
  noooooooooooooooooooooooooooooop
  kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkm
  b.q.h...............h..........b
  b.q.............ddrdd.c........b
  b.....ddsdd...c.ddddd......c...b
  b.....ddddd.....ddddd........t.b
  b.............H................b
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp i -> pasadizo2_s spawn=door
@warp n -> metropolis_neon spawn=east
